1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:01,529
Hi friends!

2
00:00:01,529 --> 00:00:02,531
I'm Mimzi,

3
00:00:02,531 --> 00:00:04,149
and this is Teddy!

4
00:00:04,699 --> 00:00:06,749
I'm hungry!

5
00:00:07,299 --> 00:00:10,224
Let's learn healthy vegetables!

6
00:00:11,924 --> 00:00:14,024
This is a carrot.

7
00:00:14,424 --> 00:00:16,973
Carrot! Can you say carrot?

8
00:00:18,373 --> 00:00:20,848
It is orange and crunchy.

9
00:00:22,548 --> 00:00:24,898
This is a potato.

10
00:00:25,298 --> 00:00:28,296
Potato! Can you say potato?

11
00:00:29,696 --> 00:00:32,721
It is brown and grows in the ground.

12
00:00:34,421 --> 00:00:36,321
What is this?

13
00:00:38,121 --> 00:00:39,746
Tomato!

14
00:00:40,296 --> 00:00:42,596
It is red and round.

15
00:00:43,146 --> 00:00:45,296
Yum, yum!

16
00:00:46,996 --> 00:00:49,271
This is a broccoli.

17
00:00:49,671 --> 00:00:52,620
Broccoli! Can you say broccoli?

18
00:00:54,020 --> 00:00:56,395
It looks like a little tree!

19
00:00:58,095 --> 00:01:00,195
This is a corn.

20
00:01:00,595 --> 00:01:03,171
Corn! Can you say corn?

21
00:01:04,571 --> 00:01:06,871
It is yellow and sweet.

22
00:01:08,571 --> 00:01:10,471
What is this?

23
00:01:12,271 --> 00:01:13,871
Peas!

24
00:01:14,421 --> 00:01:15,819
They are small,

25
00:01:15,819 --> 00:01:17,296
round and green.

26
00:01:17,846 --> 00:01:19,996
Yum, yum!

27
00:01:21,696 --> 00:01:24,545
Now let's play a memory game!

28
00:01:25,095 --> 00:01:26,683
Do you remember?

29
00:01:26,683 --> 00:01:27,770
Let's see!

30
00:01:29,470 --> 00:01:31,370
What is this?

31
00:01:33,570 --> 00:01:34,995
Carrot!

32
00:01:35,545 --> 00:01:37,845
Yes! Well done!

33
00:01:39,545 --> 00:01:41,445
What is this?

34
00:01:43,645 --> 00:01:45,346
Potato!

35
00:01:45,896 --> 00:01:47,846
That's right!

36
00:01:49,546 --> 00:01:51,446
What is this?

37
00:01:53,646 --> 00:01:55,270
Tomato!

38
00:01:55,820 --> 00:01:57,845
Great job!

39
00:01:59,545 --> 00:02:01,445
What is this?

40
00:02:03,645 --> 00:02:05,295
Broccoli!

41
00:02:05,845 --> 00:02:07,820
You got it!

42
00:02:09,520 --> 00:02:11,420
What is this?

43
00:02:13,620 --> 00:02:15,170
Corn!

44
00:02:15,720 --> 00:02:17,420
Super!

45
00:02:19,120 --> 00:02:21,020
What is this?

46
00:02:23,220 --> 00:02:24,820
Peas!

47
00:02:25,370 --> 00:02:27,020
Hooray!

48
00:02:28,720 --> 00:02:31,746
Wow! You remembered everything!

49
00:02:33,596 --> 00:02:36,246
You are a super learner!

50
00:02:37,946 --> 00:02:41,195
Vegetables make us big and strong!

51
00:02:41,745 --> 00:02:44,545
Great job, little learner!

52
00:02:45,095 --> 00:02:47,046
Share Mimzi with a friend,

53
00:02:47,046 --> 00:02:49,670
and subscribe for more learning fun!

54
00:02:50,220 --> 00:02:51,230
Next time,

55
00:02:51,230 --> 00:02:53,870
let's sing a good morning song.

56
00:02:54,120 --> 00:02:55,845
Bye bye!
